@startuml compose-state-machine
title Compose (montage) panel lifecycle (UI + composed asset)

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Hidden

Hidden : panel not mounted
Hidden : (flag off OR draft not reel/story)
Hidden --> Blocked : flag on && video-capable draft && no primary_video
Hidden --> Empty : flag on && video-capable draft && primary_video present

state Blocked {
  Blocked : 🎬 primary video missing
  Blocked : "Composer" disabled + hint
}

Blocked --> Empty : primary video generated upstream

state Empty {
  Empty : primary_video present, no composed_video
  Empty : track-presence toggles (🎙️ 🎵 💬)
  Empty : "Composer" enabled
}

Empty --> Composing : click "Composer"\n[draftId && hasPrimaryVideo]
Empty --> Empty : toggle include / export

state Composing {
  Composing : POST in flight
  Composing : controls disabled, estimator bar
}

Composing --> Ready : 200 { media }\n(role='composed_video' created)
Composing --> Error : 4xx/5xx\n(409 no-video/no-track, 502 ffmpeg/source/timeout, 400)

state Ready {
  Ready : composed_video playable (VideoPlayer)
  Ready : track summary 🎬✓ 🎙️? 🎵? 💬?
  Ready : "Recomposer" available
}

Ready --> Stale : a source track changes\n(asset still valid/playable)
Ready --> Composing : click "Recomposer"
Stale --> Composing : click "Recomposer" (emphasized)
Stale --> Ready : recompose matches current bundle

Error --> Composing : click "Réessayer"
Error --> Empty : (no asset was written)\nfix tracks & retry
Error --> Blocked : primary video was removed

note right of Composing
  mock  : byte-copy of primary, NO network,
          NO provider, NO real ffmpeg mux, cost 0
  live  : real ffmpeg mux of present tracks
  live + no extra track : 409 (mock still byte-copies)
  no primary_video      : 409 before any ffmpeg call
  ffmpeg error/timeout  : 502, temp output unlinked
end note

note bottom of Ready
  Ready asset is the video shown in:
   - PublishActionGroup confirm (D4)
   - the create-flow preview pane (prefers composed over raw)
  Optional export field: platform-spec transcode (degraded never fatal)
end note

Ready --> [*] : draft published / discarded
@enduml
